> Any advice?? Or does luck need to be with me as well as skill?

You'll need luck for your first ascension, this is rather obvious. But the
amount of luck you'll need is not that important. And even with luck,
you'll also need a lot of personnal skill.


Alternate period where you play random classes (to keep a touch of
different aspects of the game) and periods where you concentrate in one
class (to become specialised with that).

Monks, even if hard to ascend, have a fairly easy early game in my opinion
(nice starting equipement, including food, intrinsics, intrinsics,
intrinsics, don't bother with weapon/armor identification, often a really
good starting spell, can kill a gnome with one blow even at XL1 (so mines
are a valuable option)).

